  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The soup is built on a bed of softened vegetables and smoked bacon before "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "yellow split peas",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "yellow-split-pea"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and stock are added and simmered low and slow until everything collapses into a thick, hearty soup. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "No soaking is required for split peas. They break down naturally with enough cooking time."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
